<body>
<div class="wrapper">

  <div class="header">
    <div class="header-badge">Riftbound TCG Tools</div>
    <h1>Inventory <span>Sync</span></h1>
    <p>Match your Collectr portfolio against a Shopify product export to generate two CSVs: one for inventory quantities, one for prices.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- SET MAPPINGS -->

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">Set Name Mappings</div>
